'''Sentinel Hill''' is an [[Alliance]] settlement in [[Westfall]] and their last stronghold in the region. It is here that the men and women of the [[People's Militia]] make their stand against the [[Defias Brotherhood]] to keep the land free from corruption after their cause was abandoned by the Stormwind Monarchy.

